repository-code: "https://github.com/manishthatte/maniTC"
url: "https://www.manitlab.org"
abstract: >-
  ManiT is a systems programming language in which balanced
  ternary is the native number system: integers are signed by
  construction, logic is three-valued, and the fundamental
  control-flow construct is a three-way branch. maniTC is its
  compiler, with an LLVM backend for binary hosts and a T3ISA
  backend for balanced ternary hardware, including an assembler
  and cycle-accurate emulator.
keywords:
  - balanced ternary
  - compiler
  - programming language
  - LLVM
  - three-valued logic
